{"id":"n58553-1-12","stage":5,"title":"보복 · 报仇","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58553-1-12-1","ko":"왜 만날 걔한테 당하고만 있어?","zh":"你怎么总是任他欺负？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"만날","meaning":"天天，常常，老是","explanation":"만날：天天，常常，老是。","readings":[{"term":"만날","audio":"/audio/06e9ab2bbb32c974c856.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50307","senseId":"1","lemma":"만날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만날","audio":"/audio/06e9ab2bbb32c974c856.mp3"}},{"text":"걔한테","meaning":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"걔：“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"걔","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64369","senseId":"1","lemma":"걔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걔한테","audio":"/audio/0aa2d68c97369de21d0c.mp3"}},{"text":"당하고만","meaning":"遭到，受到","explanation":"당하다：遭到，受到；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"당하다","audio":"/audio/9c2599f3570a2b0ad6c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14730","senseId":"4","lemma":"당하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"당하고만","audio":"/audio/d9d0960aba3d54dffd04.mp3"}},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"06e9ab2bbb32c974","term":"만날","zh":"天天，常常，老是","audio":"/audio/06e9ab2bbb32c974c856.mp3","entryId":"50307","definition":"几乎一天不停地。","pronunciation":["만ː날"]},{"id":"6488cd1503b8fc1c","term":"걔","zh":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3","entryId":"64369","definition":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"9c2599f3570a2b0a","term":"당하다","zh":"遭到，受到","audio":"/audio/9c2599f3570a2b0ad6c8.mp3","entryId":"14730","definition":"从某人处遭受戏弄或嘲讽等不当行为。","pronunciation":["당하다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/036f021d2d8decbe6104.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58553-1-12-2","ko":"보복을 한다고 해서 뭐가 달라지겠니?","zh":"就算报复，又能改变什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"보복을","meaning":"报仇，报复","explanation":"보복：报仇，报复；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"보복","audio":"/audio/7ba8ef93dfa514cc8769.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58553","senseId":"1","lemma":"보복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보복을","audio":"/audio/f0d147f38684ff4a39b6.mp3"}},{"text":"한다고","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한다고","audio":"/audio/4ffc62f5a7d10aa4f9f6.mp3"}},{"text":"해서","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해서","audio":"/audio/91cbeb2e0a1193dc2da9.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐가","audio":"/audio/2c57e944c5dd1dbd2cf3.mp3"}},{"text":"달라지겠니?","meaning":"变，改变","explanation":"달라지다：变，改变；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"달라지다","audio":"/audio/3aa18124b2a7d459478f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62902","senseId":"1","lemma":"달라지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달라지겠니","audio":"/audio/1a84a65a943cb7a68a4b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7ba8ef93dfa514cc","term":"보복","zh":"报仇，报复","audio":"/audio/7ba8ef93dfa514cc8769.mp3","entryId":"58553","definition":"为了对所受伤害进行复仇而给对方造成相同程度的伤害。","pronunciation":["보ː복"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"3aa18124b2a7d459","term":"달라지다","zh":"变，改变","audio":"/audio/3aa18124b2a7d459478f.mp3","entryId":"62902","definition":"与以前变得不一样。","pronunciation":["달라지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/54d2a9bed92489d09cba.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.549,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58553","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":176,"sequenceScore":4.0257,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["就算报复，又能改变什么呢？","你怎么总是任他欺负？","听说你下周参加剑道升级考核？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你怎么总是任他欺负？","听说你下周参加剑道升级考核？","就算报复，又能改变什么呢？"],"answer":2}]}
